<span class="ltx_contact ltx_role_affiliation"><span class="ltx_contact_name">Affiliation: </span>Politecnico di Milano
</span></span></span></span>
<span class="ltx_author_before">  </span><span class="ltx_creator ltx_role_author">
<span class="ltx_personname">Daniel Z. Kaplan
</span><span class="ltx_author_notes"><span class="ltx_author_notes_content">
