<section id="A4" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix D </span>Results on Qwen2.5-Math-7B-Instruct</h2>

<div id="A4.p1" class="ltx_para">
<p id="A4.p1.1" class="ltx_p">We evaluate whether the dataset pruned using a specific model (LLaMA-3-8B-Instruct) would transfer its benefits when applied to a different model family. We report the full results on Qwen2.5-Math-7B-Instruct in Table <a href="#A4.T2" title="Table 2 ‣ Appendix D Results on Qwen2.5-Math-7B-Instruct ‣ Influence Functions for Efficient Data Selection in Reasoning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">2</span></a>.</p>
</div>
<figure id="A4.T2" class="ltx_table">
<figcaption class="ltx_caption ltx_centering"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_table"><span id="A4.T2.6" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">Table 2</span>: </span><span id="A4.T2.7" class="ltx_text" style="font-size:90%;">
<span id="A4.T2.7.1" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">Results on <span id="A4.T2.7.1.1" class="ltx_text">Qwen2.5-Math-7B-Instruct</span>.</span> Pass@1 with <math id="A4.T2.m2" class="ltx_Math" alttext="N{=}8" display="inline" intent=":literal"><semantics><mrow><mi>N</mi><mo>=</mo><mn>8</mn></mrow><annotation encoding="application/x-tex">N{=}8</annotation></semantics></math> samples, zero-shot CoT.
Same setup as Table <a href="#S4.T1" title="Table 1 ‣ 4 Experiments and Results ‣ Influence Functions for Efficient Data Selection in Reasoning" class="ltx_ref"><span class="ltx_text ltx_ref_tag">1</span></a>, but we fine-tune Qwen2.5-Math-7B-Instruct on pruned subsets selected using <span id="A4.T2.7.2" class="ltx_text">LLaMA-3-8B-Instruct</span>, testing their transfer across model families. Best in <span id="A4.T2.7.3" class="ltx_text ltx_font_bold">bold</span>. Amount of samples kept in [brackets].
</span></figcaption>
